        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "End terrace three bedroom home, extended to the rear, in Droghedas town center. \n\nThe property qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant which makes it an ideal project for buyers looking to modernise and add value. \n\nLarge front and rear gardens, generous side entrance.\n\nAccommodation includes Living room, kitchen, dining room, main bathroom and three bedrooms. Located within walking distance of Lourdes Hospital the town centre schools shops and bus routes this is a solid home ready for refurbishment in a highly convenient setting. \n\nLocated in a long established residential area, Liam Leech is within walking distance of Drogheda town centre, local schools, shops, bus routes, and a range of amenities. \nAccess to the M1 north and south bound is also close by.\n\nThis property represents a superb opportunity for buyers seeking a home they can transform to their own taste while availing of significant refurbishment supports or the property investor alike. \n\nFeatures\nShort distance from Drogheda town centre\nAccess to M1 close by\nMature development\nOil fired central heating\nSecure side entrance\nQualifies for vacant property grant\nInvestment opportunity\nHeld freehold\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nLiving Room\nSolid flooring, solid fuel fireplace, coving and ceiling rose\n\nDining Room\nSolid flooring, Storage\n\nKitchen\nSolid units, tiled flooring and splashback\n\nMain Bathroom\nTiled throughout, WHB, toilet, Shower enclosure\n\nBedroom 1\nLaminate flooring, built in storage\n\nBedroom 2\nLaminate flooring\n\nBedroom 3\nLaminate flooring\n\nConstruction\nThe property is of a typical concrete construction with a red brick outer leaf, double glazing, uPVC front and rear doors. uPVC fascia, soffit and downpipes. \n\noutside\nEnclosed rear garden with concrete built boundary walls, large side entry, rear patio, block built garden shed (wired and plumbed)\n\n\nEssential services\nMains water\nMains sewerage\nOFCH\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only\n\nNegotiator\nAnthony Byrne\nAssocSCSI/AssocRICS\nH.Cert. Property Studies\nN.Dip. Building Surveying\nlicense no. 003939-007400\nPhone: 041 98 49930\n\n"
      },
